":\"Our commitment to transparency\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-1\",\"children\":\"The Points Guy believes that credit cards can transform lives, helping you leverage everyday spending for cash back or travel experiences that might otherwise be out of reach. We publish editorial content and card reviews to help you find a great card to turn your goals into reality.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3\",\"children\":[\"We may earn compensation when a customer clicks on a link, when an application is approved, or when an account is opened with our partners. This may impact how or where products appear. While we don’t cover all available credit cards, our editorial team creates and maintains our analysis of cards. Editorial content is not influenced by nor subject to review by any credit card company, bank or partner prior to or after publication. Read our\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L2f\",null,{\"className\":\"underline\",\"href\":\"/advertising-policy/\",\"prefetch\":false,\"children\":\"advertising policy\"}],\" \",\"and\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L2f\",null,{\"className\":\"underline\",\"href\":\"/review-methodology/\",\"prefetch\":false,\"children\":\"product review methodology\"}],\" \",\"for more information.\"]}]]}]]}]\n54:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-border mt-12 pt-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"small\",null,{\"className\":\"block text-center text-legal-longform\",\"children\":\"Copyright © 2026 The Points Guy, LLC. All rights reserved. A Red Ventures company.\"}]}]\n67:I[614695,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0tw2t700fyqit.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/367o2sap7r51y.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2o64-mj78bn7x.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1kydg6-wf_2ru.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2vtzmyund5gty.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/062ot4_5c03mk.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3uxl39ayuaep4.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0gc-866r29c90.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3y0gs0swltyv-.js\"